{"title":"Career Roadmap · Finance Executive","role":"Finance Executive","summary":"A Finance Executive supports an organisation's financial operations through accounting, financial reporting, reconciliations, budgeting, payables/receivables, compliance support, financial analysis, and management reporting.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Accounting & Finance"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Accounting & Finance","Finance/Accounts Internship","Finance Executive","Senior Finance Executive","Finance Analyst / Assistant Manager Finance","Finance Manager","Financial Controller"]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"“Finance Executive” is a broad industry title. Depending on the employer, the role may be closer to accounting operations, FP&A, reporting, treasury, taxation, or corporate finance. The student should specialise after building strong accounting fundamentals."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Industry Direction","What to Build"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Digital accounting & finance operations"},{"text":"Accounting, Excel, ERP, reconciliations"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Automated finance processes"},{"text":"Power Query, Power BI, automation"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Data-driven finance"},{"text":"Financial modelling, SQL, analytics"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Strategic finance"},{"text":"FP&A, forecasting, business partnering"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"AI-assisted finance"},{"text":"AI analytics, automated reporting, scenario modelling"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Intelligent finance functions"},{"text":"AI-supported planning, risk, treasury and decision systems"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build Thi