olution"},{"type":"p","text":"Finance teams will increasingly use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated bookkeeping"},{"text":"AI forecasting"},{"text":"Intelligent reconciliation"},{"text":"Continuous controls monitoring"},{"text":"Automated financial reporting"},{"text":"AI-assisted FP&A"},{"text":"Real-time financial dashboards"},{"text":"Predictive cash-flow analysis"},{"text":"Automated anomaly detection"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The finance professional's role will shift from:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Prepare the numbers.”"},{"type":"p","text":"toward:"},{"type":"h","text":"“Validate the numbers, interpret them, manage risk and guide business decisions.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"AP/AR"},{"text":"Closing processes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial analysis"},{"text":"Budgeting"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"Variance analysis"},{"text":"Working capital"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tally/ERP"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Awareness"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GST"},{"text":"TDS"},{"text":"Tax fundamentals"},{"text":"Internal controls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Business writing"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Attention to detail"},{"text":"Analytical thinking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Automation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RPA"},{"text":"Automated reporting"},{"text":"AI-assisted analysis"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"typ